<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext="x minus 12"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>, not <math alttext="3 x minus 12"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>.</p>
