n  <clipPath id=\"p887e5fe9dd\">\n   <rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"255.6036\" x=\"12.6432\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a line\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>The line slants sharply down from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points: <ul><li>(negative 1 comma 7)</li><li>(0 comma 3)</li></ul></li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of the linear function <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis plus 19\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></math> is shown. If <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"d\"><mi>d</mi>\n</math> are positive constants, which equation could define <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>?</p>","type":"mcq","correct_answer":["A"]},"createDate":1730147357389,"updateDate":1730147357389}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1730147357389, 1730147357389),
