</math>, so each of the three values of <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math> can be substituted in the given inequality to compare the corresponding values of <math alttext="y"><mi>y</mi>
</math> in each of the tables. Substituting <math alttext="3"><mn>3</mn>
