</math> in the given inequality yields <math alttext="y greater than 13 left parenthesis 3 right parenthesis minus 18"><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>13</mn><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></math>, or <math alttext="y greater than 21"><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>21</mn></math>. Therefore, when <math alttext="x equals 3"><mrow>
	<mi>x</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>3</mn>
</mrow>
